{"id":"7f3094a41722b9e6","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-sigma1-degree-no-pseudocomplement.md","title":"A Sigma-1 Degree Without a Pseudocomplement","display":"thm-sigma1-degree-no-pseudocomplement — A Sigma-1 Degree Without a Pseudocomplement","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-sigma1-degree-no-pseudocomplement","aliases":["67-thm-sigma1-degree-no-pseudocomplement"],"display":"thm-sigma1-degree-no-pseudocomplement — A Sigma-1 Degree Without a Pseudocomplement","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]","[[67-df-degree-complexity]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_chapter":"7","source_section":"§3","source_label":"Theorem 7.17 (strengthening Theorem 7.5)","source_printed_pages":[113,114],"source_pdf_pages":[124,125],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"book-proof-read including Lemmas 7.23-7.24; earlier conservativity dependencies not independently audited","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-sigma1-degree-no-pseudocomplement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-sigma1-degree-no-pseudocomplement</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sigma1-degree-no-pseudocomplement — A Sigma-1 Degree Without a Pseudocomplement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e819ca0a85388cbb\" href=\"?note=e819ca0a85388cbb\" title=\"67-df-degree-pseudocomplement\">67-df-degree-pseudocomplement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 7.17 (strengthening Theorem 7.5)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>113</span><span>114</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>124</span><span>125</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"book-proof-read including Lemmas 7.23-7.24; earlier conservativity dependencies not independently audited"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\mathsf S_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\mathsf S_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"73717706953334f5\" href=\"?note=73717706953334f5\" title=\"67-df-degree-complexity\">67-df-degree-complexity</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PC}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PC}_T\\)</span> 及部分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pc}_T\">\\(\\operatorname{pc}_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e819ca0a85388cbb\" href=\"?note=e819ca0a85388cbb\" title=\"67-df-degree-pseudocomplement\">67-df-degree-pseudocomplement</a>。</li>\n<li>基础理论仍为一致 r.e. 理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists a\\in\\mathsf S_T\\;\\forall b\\in D_T\\;\\neg\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists a\\in\\mathsf S_T\\;\\forall b\\in D_T\\;\\neg\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_T\\nsubseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pc}_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf S_T\\nsubseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pc}_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书第7章定理17（印刷113–114页，PDF124–125页）；它加强印刷99页定理5的“存在没有伪补的度”。这里保留定理17的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 限定，未把有界分配格误写成任意集合都存在上下确界的完备格。</p>\n<p>已阅读引理23–24及定理17的证明：构造一列严格递降的有限复杂度度，使某组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 上界没有最大下界；再用引理6把这个不存在的最大下界等同于候选伪补应满足的条件，导出无伪补。涉及部分保守性与非 r.e. 句集的辅助证明链本次未独立全部重建；该原子记录来源陈述与书面证明阅读，不宣称机器验证或独立完全证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-pseudocomplement","status":"resolved","id":"e819ca0a85388cbb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-complexity]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-complexity","status":"resolved","id":"73717706953334f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathsf S_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{PC}_T$ 及部分函数 $\\operatorname{pc}_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-pseudocomplement","status":"resolved","id":"e819ca0a85388cbb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathsf S_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-complexity]]；$\\mathrm{PC}_T$ 及部分函数 $\\operatorname{pc}_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-pseudocomplement]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,\\mathsf S_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PC}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pc}_T","display":false},{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists a\\in\\mathsf S_T\\;\\forall b\\in D_T\\;\\neg\\mathrm{PC}_T(a;b).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_T\\nsubseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pc}_T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":2073,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-173","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-sigma1-degree-no-pseudocomplement]]"}],"outgoing":["e819ca0a85388cbb","73717706953334f5"]}